TRANSLATION:
Bu akşamki gösteriye gelenler
için özel hediyeler bile{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
hazırladım.{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} Umarım{{TAG:0003:0001:}} sen de gelebilirsin!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}How can I help you?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
I've got a design!
Just chatting.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿En qué puedo ayudarte?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
¡He creado un diseño!
Me apetece charlar

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}En quoi puis-je vous aider ?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
J'ai un motif !
Je veux juste papoter.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Posso esserti d'aiuto?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Ho un modello per te!
Parliamo un po'.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Was kann ich für dich tun?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Ich hab ein Design!
Ich will nur plaudern.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Nasıl yardımcı olabilirim?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Bir tasarımım var! Sadece sohbet
ediyorum.

EN:
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Oh my!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}You've really brought me an
idea for the show? That's so cool!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Please show me the custom design!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Aman!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Gösteri için gerçekten bir
fikir mi getirdin? Çok güzel!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Özel tasarımını gösterir misin?

EN:
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Oh my!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}You've got another idea?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I wonder what kind of custom
design you've brought this time!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}¡Hala!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}¿Tienes otro diseño?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ay, a ver qué maravilla me
has traído esta vez...

IT:
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ti è venuta un'altra idea?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Chissà quale modello personalizzato
mi avrai portato questa volta!

DE:
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Noch eine Designidee?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Da bin ich ja mal gespannt, was du
dir diesmal ausgedacht hast!

EN:
Oh, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}did you change your mind?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}This is a very special opportunity,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
so if you change your mind, {{TAG:0003:0001:}}please
don't hesitate to talk to me again!

ES:
Oh, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿no me lo quieres enseñar?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}¡Es que es una oportunidad única!{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Bueno, si cambias de idea, {{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡avísame,
por favor!

IT:
Accifuffoli, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}ci hai ripensato?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Si tratta di un evento speciale,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
quindi se dovessi cambiare
idea {{TAG:0003:0001:}}torna pure a parlarmi!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Che modello fuffoso!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Farò di tutto
per inserirlo nello spettacolo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Prima che mi dimentichi:{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
se lo cambierai nel frattempo,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
cambieranno anche i fuochi!
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Non ho idea di come sia possibile,{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
ma succede veramente! {{TAG:0003:0023:}}Chi prepara
lo spettacolo deve essere un mago!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Çok güzel bir tasarım!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Bunu
gösteride havai fişeğe
dönüştürmek için hemen çalışmaya{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
başlayacağım. Ama{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} küçük bir
uyarı: Az önce verdiğin tasarımı{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
değiştirirsen havai{{TAG:0003:000B:}} fişek de
değişir! Uzmanların bunu nasıl
anladığını ben de{{TAG:0003:0001:}} bilmiyorum.{{TAG:0003:0023:}}
Çok gizemli!

{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Bugün çok fikir geldi;{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
gösterinin{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} harika{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} tasarımlarla
dolacağına eminim!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}That's a very lovely design!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}I'll start working on putting this
design into the show right away!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Qué diseño más encantador!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Me pondré manos a la obra
ahora mismo.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Vous avez un vrai talent !{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Je vais de
ce pas commencer à travailler sur
votre petit chef-d'œuvre.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

DE:
Ich habe ein paar Geschenke für das
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Feuerwerk {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}heute Abend besorgt,{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
also komm doch später mal vorbei!

TRANSLATION:
Bu akşamki havai fişek gösterisi
için özel hediyeler{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} hazırlamaya{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
vakit buldum{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}.{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Sonra yanıma uğra!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Reiner {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}eröffnet zum {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Feuerwerk{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
einen kleinen Stand. Ich bin schon
gespannt, was er anzubieten hat!

TRANSLATION:
Gösteri{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} saat 19{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.00'a kadar{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
başlamayacak{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}. Akşama dek
işlerine rahatça devam edebilirsin!

ES:
No queda casi nada para que
empiecen los fuegos.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Ay, estoy muy nerviosa! ¿Tú no?

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hoy me han dado un montón de
diseños originales para los fuegos.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡Vaya espectáculo nos espera!
